  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Repeated maritime disruptions in the Gulf/Strait routes raise freight times, insurance and inventory costs for technology supply chains, forcing firms to reroute shipments, shift suppliers or relocate production to reduce exposure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">china_tech_pressure</data>
</edge>
