  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute shipping disruptions raise near-term goods prices and trigger central-bank tightening expectations that push up short-term yields more than long-term yields, flattening the yield curve (reducing short‑minus‑long spreads).</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">global_finance_shock</data>
